        "original_id": "72e7115d-3242-578d-ad04-52b813e1c49d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Yann Martel\n- Works: The Facts Behind the Helsinki Roccamatios, Life of Pi\n- Companies: Knopf Canada\n- Topics: publication, reception, popularity\n\nFacts:\n- Knopf Canada first published The Facts Behind the Helsinki Roccamatios as a paperback in spring 1993.\n- The Facts Behind the Helsinki Roccamatios received little attention outside Canada until 2004.\n- Yann Martel published Life of Pi, a Canadian fantasy adventure novel, in 2001.\n- Life of Pi became award-winning and gained worldwide popularity by 2004.\n- Interest in Yann Martel's work after the success of Life of Pi increased attention to The Facts Behind the Helsinki Roccamatios outside Canada in 2004.",
